// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig for private local build values.
// Keep client secrets, access tokens, and other private values out of source control.
// The shipped GitHub client ID is intentionally set in Shared.xcconfig after this file.

// GitHub currently requires this OAuth app exchange credential even with PKCE.
// For a backend-free native build it must be treated as public/non-confidential.
// Provision a dedicated Buddy OAuth app; never reuse another app's credential.
// BUDDY_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET = dedicated-buddy-oauth-app-exchange-credential
